    id: "20260804-046",
    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "CISA將N-able N-central的CVE-2026-18577列入已知漏洞清單，警告帳號接管風險",
    summary: "美國網路安全基礎設施局（CISA）已將一個高嚴重性漏洞CVE-2026-18577納入其已知漏洞清單（KEV），因發現其正在野外被積極利用。此漏洞是針對N-able N-central的，屬於未完全修補CVE-2026-18556的後果，允許攻擊者透過替代路徑或通道進行身份驗證繞過，進而達成帳號接管。成功利用此漏洞的遠端攻擊者可以取得N-central伺服器的管理權限，並濫用內建的「Take Control」功能，進一步滲透到受管理的終端設備，部署持久性機制。建議受影響的組織應立即升級至版本2026.3 HF1。此外，CISA建議聯邦民用行政部門（FCEB）機構在2026年8月6日前修補此漏洞，並審查N-central的「Take Control」活動紀錄。安全廠商觀察到攻擊者利用此漏洞進行高階偵察、橫向移動等惡意行為，並觀察到部分惡意連線來自知名的VPN出口節點IP位址。",
    tags: ["CISA", "N-able N-central", "CVE-2026-18577", "KEV", "RMM", "身份驗證繞過"],
    title_en: "CISA Adds N-able N-central's CVE-2026-18577 to Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog, Warning Account Takeover Risk",
    summary_en: "The U.S. Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA) has added a high-severity vulnerability, CVE-2026-18577, to its Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) catalog, due to active exploitation in the wild. This vulnerability affects N-able N-central and is a consequence of the unpatched CVE-2026-18556, allowing attackers to bypass authentication through an alternative path or channel, thereby achieving account takeover. Remote attackers who successfully exploit this vulnerability can gain administrative privileges on the N-central server and abuse the built-in \"Take Control\" function to further penetrate managed endpoints and deploy persistence mechanisms. Affected organizations are advised to immediately upgrade to version 2026.3 HF1. Furthermore, CISA recommends that Federal Civilian Executive Branch (FCEB) agencies patch this vulnerability before August 6, 2026, and review N-central \"Take Control\" activity logs. Security vendors have observed attackers using this vulnerability for malicious activities such as advanced reconnaissance and lateral movement, and have noted that some malicious connections originate from known VPN exit node IP addresses.",
    tags_en: ["CISA", "N-able N-central", "CVE-2026-18577", "KEV", "RMM", "Authentication Bypass"],
    sources: [
      { name: "iThome", url: "https://ithome.com.tw/news/177854", lang: "ZH-TW" },
      { name: "The Hacker News", url: "https://thehackernews.com/2026/08/cisa-adds-exploited-n-able-n-central.html", lang: "EN" }
    ]
