    summary: "本文報導指出，三星（Samsung）的 Galaxy Z Fold 8 系列，包括 Fold 8 Ultra 和 Flip 8，在預購期間的銷售量已達到 144 萬台，創下紀錄。這一數字超越了先前由 Galaxy Note 10 在 2019 年創下的 138 萬台紀錄。由於訂單量激增，三星甚至需要延遲出貨時間。相較於前代產品，Z Fold 8 系列的市場反應顯著更佳。雖然文章未提供具體的漏洞或安全細節，但它強調了該產品線的極高人氣和市場成功。消費者在購買時應留意可能的出貨延遲。",
    tags: ["Samsung", "Galaxy Z Fold 8", "Galaxy Note 10", "Android", "手機市場"],
    title_en: "Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 8 Series Pre-orders Break Records, Surpassing Galaxy Note 10 Sales",
    summary_en: "This report indicates that Samsung's Galaxy Z Fold 8 series, including the Fold 8 Ultra and Flip 8, has achieved a record-breaking pre-order volume of 1.44 million units. This figure surpasses the previous record set by the Galaxy Note 10 in 2019, which was 1.38 million units. Due to the surge in orders, Samsung has even had to delay shipping times. The market response to the Z Fold 8 series is significantly better compared to its predecessor. Although the article does not provide specific vulnerabilities or security details, it emphasizes the product line's immense popularity and market success. Consumers should be aware of potential shipping delays when purchasing.",
