    id: "20260804-085",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Microsoft Teams推出「報告疑慮」功能，強化對AI深偽會議、詐騙與冒充的防禦",
    summary: "隨著AI技術的發展，線上會議中的詐騙、冒充與深偽（deepfake）威脅日益增加。Microsoft為應對此趨勢，宣布在Teams中推出「報告疑慮」（Report a concern）功能，旨在讓參與者能即時標記可疑活動。此功能不僅可在會議中直接使用，還會透過Microsoft Defender入口網站和Teams管理中心提供給安全團隊進行深入調查。報告內容可涵蓋釣魚、冒充、詐騙或社會工程等行為，有助於組織評估潛在威脅並採取適當行動。此外，Microsoft也將推出新功能來偵測外部會議機器人（bots），讓組織能掌握會議中的AI活動，確保沒有未經授權的AI參與。此舉顯示Microsoft正積極利用其生態系統，為企業用戶提供更全面的AI安全與治理工具。",
    tags: ["Microsoft Teams", "AI深偽", "報告疑慮", "安全威脅", "Microsoft Defender", "社會工程"],
    title_en: "Microsoft Teams introduces 'Report a concern' feature to enhance defense against AI deepfake meetings, fraud, and impersonation",
    summary_en: "With the advancement of AI technology, threats such as fraud, impersonation, and deepfakes in online meetings are increasing. To address this trend, Microsoft has announced the launch of the 'Report a concern' feature in Teams, designed to allow participants to instantly flag suspicious activities. This feature can not only be used directly during meetings but will also be provided to security teams through the Microsoft Defender portal and Teams admin center for in-depth investigation. Reported content can cover activities such as phishing, impersonation, fraud, or social engineering, helping organizations assess potential threats and take appropriate action. Furthermore, Microsoft will introduce new functionalities to detect external meeting bots, allowing organizations to monitor AI activities within meetings and ensure no unauthorized AI participation. This move demonstrates Microsoft's active utilization of its ecosystem to provide enterprise users with more comprehensive AI security and governance tools.",
    tags_en: ["Microsoft Teams", "AI deepfake", "Report a concern", "Security threat", "Microsoft Defender", "Social engineering"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Windows Latest", url: "https://windowslatest.com/2026/08/04/microsoft-teams-is-fighting-ai-deepfake-meetings-with-a-new-report-button-rolling-out-august-2026", lang: "EN" }
    ]
