    id: "20260804-116",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "NASA決定採用Tesla Cybertruck作為登陸場救援車輛，取代傳統MRAP車型",
    summary: "儘管Tesla Cybertruck曾多次召回修復外觀飾板脫落或加速踏板卡住等問題，NASA仍決定將這款車輛用於未來載人任務的發射場救援用途。傳統上，NASA使用重型裝甲軍用人員運輸車（MRAP）作為應急撤離車，MRAP具有極高的防護性，甚至被形容為「如同銀行金庫」。然而，NASA人員指出，Cybertruck相較於MRAP更快速、更易於操作（特別是在戴手套的情況下），且使用它能避免為發射任務安排MRAP的支援人員，從而節省資源。Cybertruck由不鏽鋼製成，並宣稱其玻璃具有抗衝擊能力。本次任務是SpaceX Crew-13，載有四名太空人前往國際太空站（ISS）。雖然NASA強調Cybertruck的優勢，但文章指出，SpaceX在2026年已進行了大量發射，使得Cybertruck作為救援車輛的實戰檢驗可能性極低。",
    tags: ["NASA", "Tesla", "Cybertruck", "MRAP", "SpaceX", "太空任務"],
    title_en: "NASA Decides to Adopt Tesla Cybertruck as Launch Site Rescue Vehicle, Replacing Traditional MRAP Vehicles",
    summary_en: "Despite multiple recalls concerning the Tesla Cybertruck, including issues with exterior panel detachment or accelerator pedal sticking, NASA has decided to use the vehicle for future crewed mission rescue purposes at launch sites. Traditionally, NASA has utilized Mine-Resistant Ambush Protected (MRAP) vehicles as emergency evacuation vehicles. MRAPs are known for their extremely high level of protection, even being described as 'like a bank vault.' However, NASA personnel pointed out that the Cybertruck is faster and easier to maneuver than the MRAP (especially when wearing gloves), and using it eliminates the need to allocate MRAP support personnel for the launch mission, thereby conserving resources. The Cybertruck is constructed from stainless steel and boasts impact-resistant glass. This mission is for SpaceX Crew-13, carrying four astronauts to the International Space Station (ISS). While NASA emphasizes the Cybertruck's advantages, the article notes that since SpaceX has conducted numerous launches in 2026, the possibility of the Cybertruck being practically tested as a rescue vehicle is extremely low.",
    tags_en: ["NASA", "Tesla", "Cybertruck", "MRAP", "SpaceX", "Space Mission"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/science/2026/08/04/nasa-puts-astronauts-lives-in-the-hands-of-teslas-flaky-cybertruck/5282628", lang: "EN" }
    ]
